---
// Rule stacking vs a process-driven SOP: a pile of unordered rules leaves the model asking which one applies; the five-step file-processing SOP tells it which stage it is in and what comes next.
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 512"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-rvs-title d2-rvs-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-rvs-title">Rule stacking vs. a process-driven SOP</title>
	<desc id="d2-rvs-desc">
		Left: a rule pile of unordered cards with no flowchart and no priority: back up config files, verify file
		integrity, missing file then stop, stream files over 1MB, check the file type. When several match, which one
		applies? And what about situations no rule covers? Right: the file processing standard operating procedure as an
		ordered chain. Step 1 Validation checks the file exists and is accessible; if not found, log error and stop.
		Step 2 Classification determines the type by extension and content. Step 3 Preprocessing backs up config files
		and streams files over 1MB. Step 4 Execution runs the core logic by file type. Step 5 Verification ensures the
		integrity of the processed file.
	</desc>
	<defs>
		<marker id="d2-rvs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">Rule stacking vs. a process-driven SOP</text>

	<!-- Left: rule pile -->
	<g class="dg-container dg-neutral">
		<rect x="2" y="44" width="250" height="460" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="14" y="72" font-weight="700">Rule pile</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="40" y="92" width="200" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="56" y="118">Back up config files</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="14" y="148" width="200" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="30" y="174">Verify file integrity</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="40" y="204" width="200" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="56" y="230">Missing file → stop</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="14" y="260" width="200" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="30" y="286">Stream files &gt;1MB</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="40" y="316" width="200" height="40" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="56" y="342">Check the file type</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-env">
		<rect x="14" y="384" width="226" height="98" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="30" y="410" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Several match:</text>
		<text x="30" y="432" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">which applies?</text>
		<text x="30" y="464" class="dg-sub">Not covered: then what?</text>
	</g>

	<!-- Right: SOP chain -->
	<g class="dg-container dg-neutral">
		<rect x="268" y="44" width="450" height="460" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="280" y="72" font-weight="700">Process-driven SOP</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="280" y="92" width="280" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="296" y="115" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Step 1: Validation</text>
		<text x="296" y="137" class="dg-sub">exists and accessible?</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="280" y="176" width="280" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="296" y="199" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Step 2: Classification</text>
		<text x="296" y="221" class="dg-sub">type by extension, content</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="280" y="260" width="280" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="296" y="283" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Step 3: Preprocessing</text>
		<text x="296" y="305" class="dg-sub">back up config; stream &gt;1MB</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="280" y="344" width="280" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="296" y="367" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Step 4: Execution</text>
		<text x="296" y="389" class="dg-sub">core logic by file type</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="280" y="428" width="280" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="296" y="451" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Step 5: Verification</text>
		<text x="296" y="473" class="dg-sub">integrity of processed file</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="594" y="82" width="114" height="76" rx="8"></rect>
		<text x="606" y="104" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Not found:</text>
		<text x="606" y="126">log error</text>
		<text x="606" y="148">and stop</text>
	</g>

	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="560" y1="120" x2="592" y2="120" marker-end="url(#d2-rvs-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="420" y1="148" x2="420" y2="174" marker-end="url(#d2-rvs-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="420" y1="232" x2="420" y2="258" marker-end="url(#d2-rvs-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="420" y1="316" x2="420" y2="342" marker-end="url(#d2-rvs-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="420" y1="400" x2="420" y2="426" marker-end="url(#d2-rvs-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
</svg>
